      "Provides a multi-stage Node.js Dockerfile with a non-root runtime user and health check.",
      "Provides Kubernetes Deployment, Service, Ingress, resource, probe, and security-context examples.",
      "Provides Helm values for application configuration and scaling.",
      "Provides Terraform examples for AWS VPC, EKS, remote state, and RDS resources.",
      "Provides ArgoCD and External Secrets configuration examples."
    ],
